        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Richard Levinson, William Link, Bruce Geller, Joe Mannix\n- TV series: Mannix\n- Roles: creator, developer, executive producer, private investigator, lyricist, screenwriter, director, television producer\n\nFacts:\n- Bruce Geller was born on October 13, 1930.\n- Bruce Bernard Geller was an American lyricist, screenwriter, director, and television producer.\n- The television series Mannix was created by Richard Levinson and William Link.\n- Bruce Geller developed Mannix as executive producer.\n- Joe Mannix is the title character of Mannix.\n- Joe Mannix is a private investigator.\n- Bruce Geller died on May 21, 1978.",
